                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "842c7f78-a483-3fb3-bf27-d547adad90cb",
                        "entry_id": "69828f8d-01de-3127-89a5-f26504ae22bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "филос. направление в этике, признающее наслаждение высшим благом, целью жизни; стремление к удовольствиям, наслаждениям"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bffbd480-1d64-44d5-ae7b-931ff34f73e1",
                                "sense_id": "842c7f78-a483-3fb3-bf27-d547adad90cb",
                                "text": "Гедонизм, эта вывернутая наизнанку идеология страдания, видит в страдании самом по себе зло и оказывается бессильным бороться с корнями зла, с источником страдания."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9eb089ef-50a9-4794-b6ea-f20a624a85da",
                        "source_entry_id": "69828f8d-01de-3127-89a5-f26504ae22bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "842c7f78-a483-3fb3-bf27-d547adad90cb",
                        "target_lang_word": "hedonism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hedonism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "271498a8-a8da-3e16-80db-f97dafdf5d06",
                                        "entry_id": "11fbf743-1df8-32ce-92c6-c49d3713ee7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The philosophical belief that happiness, particularly sensual pleasure, is the highest good in life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e865bb55-64b8-422c-a14e-999254c5ff0f",
                                                "sense_id": "271498a8-a8da-3e16-80db-f97dafdf5d06",
                                                "text": "It began with his shrugging off of both family and faith and taking the Amtrak Vermonter out of Penn Station to major in minor hedonism and minor in the major modernists at a hippie college in the great Jewless north."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "daae4f58-55be-3ac0-8ade-62c070a988fa",
                                        "entry_id": "11fbf743-1df8-32ce-92c6-c49d3713ee7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A general devotion to the pursuit of pleasure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
